# Both values are public by design: NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined into the client
# bundle, so every visitor receives them anyway. What protects the data is
# row-level security, not the secrecy of this key — anonymous writes are
# rejected on cars, admins and the storage bucket.
#
# Setting the same names in the Vercel dashboard overrides this file, which is
# the path to take when the key is ever rotated.
